        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "criteria for the selection of eligible entities to receive grants"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:1649 | (B) may give preference to any eligible entity that consists of a partnership between a governmental entity and a nongovernmental entity.
