`s 2020(t)(5)(B) the Secretary may give preference to the eligible entity` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the eligible entity consists of a partnership between a governmental entity and a nongovernmental entity` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any eligible entity that consists of a partnership between a governmental entity and a nongovernmental entity"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

