-- src:1690 | Not later than 18 months after December 20, 2018, the Secretary shall promulgate regulations (which shall include interim final regulations) to carry out this subsection that—
@ref s 2020(x)(3) (src:1690)
GIVEN `the day the Secretary promulgated the regulations` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
-- A period test: 18 months after 20 December 2018 is 20 June 2020; TRUE on that day, FALSE on the day after.
`s 2020(x)(3) the regulations were promulgated not later than 18 months after December 20, 2018` MEANS
    `the day the Secretary promulgated the regulations` AT MOST (`add months` (Date 20 12 2018) 18)

DECLARE `s 2020(x)(3) item of the regulations` IS ONE OF
    `s 2020(x)(3)(A) incorporate best practices and lessons learned from the pilot program under section 2036c(c)`
    `s 2020(x)(3)(B) require a State agency to take appropriate action with respect to each indication of multiple issuance or each indication that an individual receiving benefits in 1 State has applied to receive them in another State`
    `s 2020(x)(3)(C) establish standards to limit and protect the information submitted through or retained by the National Accuracy Clearinghouse`
    `s 2020(x)(3)(D) establish safeguards to protect the information and its privacy`
    `s 2020(x)(3)(E) include such other rules and standards as the Secretary determines appropriate`
    `s 2020(x)(3) any other item`

-- src:1691 | (A) incorporate best practices and lessons learned from the pilot program under section 2036c(c) of this title;
-- src:1692 | (B) require a State agency to take appropriate action, as determined by the Secretary, with respect to each indication of multiple issuance of supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits, or each indication that an individual receiving such benefits in 1 State has applied to receive such benefits in another State, while ensuring timely and fair service to applicants for, and recipients of, such benefits;
-- src:1693 | (C) establish standards to limit and protect the information submitted through or retained by the National Accuracy Clearinghouse consistent with paragraph (2)(C);
-- src:1694 | (D) establish safeguards to protect—
-- src:1695 | (i) the information submitted through or retained by the National Accuracy Clearinghouse, including by limiting the period of time that information is retained to the period necessary to accomplish the purpose described in paragraph (2)(A); and
-- src:1696 | (ii) the privacy of information that is submitted through or retained by the National Accuracy Clearinghouse consistent with subsection (e)(8); and
-- src:1697 | (E) include such other rules and standards the Secretary determines appropriate to carry out this subsection.
-- jural: individuals whose information is shared | the Secretary | claim and duty: the regulations carry five elements
@ref s 2020(x)(3) (src:1691-1697)
GIVEN `the item` IS A `s 2020(x)(3) item of the regulations`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2020(x)(3) the regulations must contain the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the item`
    WHEN `s 2020(x)(3) any other item` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text names five items
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

